     "published": "2026-11-06T11:05:36+00:00",
     "summary": "Greece has introduced a 10% tax on cryptocurrency capital gains, beginning in 2027.",
     "explain": "A crypto tax is a levy on profits made when selling digital assets like Bitcoin for more than they were purchased. DeFi, or Decentralized Finance, refers to financial services (like lending or trading) built on blockchain technology that operate without traditional intermediaries like banks. This matters because it signals a shift toward stricter government oversight of digital asset wealth.",
